  "DYNASTY HYPERSPHERE  \u00b7  ROTHSCHILD",
  "120 lives, 43 marriages (counted from the build's geometry of loom-view.json). Red = Rothschild descent, ecru = in-law; a dashed, dimmer thread is an estimated year (5 threads).",
